# i18n

Default locale is `kk`. Codes: `kk`, `ru`, `en` (`no_prefix`). Messages: `frontend/i18n/locales/{kk,ru,en}.json`. Language UI: `LangSwitch.vue`.

Add or rename a UI string in **all three** JSON files in the same change.

```json
// ❌ BAD — only en.json
{ "export_failed": "Export failed" }

// ✅ GOOD — same key in kk.json, ru.json, and en.json
```

Do not add a fourth locale or change `defaultLocale` unless asked. Keep `LangSwitch` on `kk | ru | en` only.
